The taxi is gone.
I am standing on the street.
The street is dark and quiet.
The building is old and very big.
Where is the door?
Ah, there is the front door.
Next to the door there is a bell panel.
There are very many names here!
I am looking for the name Weber.
He rents out the room.
I read the names.
Müller, Schmidt, Krüger, Weber.
There is the name!
Next to the name it says: rear building, second floor.
So that is my new address.
I open the heavy door.
I walk with the suitcase into the courtyard.
Now I am looking for the staircase.
